{"id":"723131cba3211ffa","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-regular-open-set.md","title":"ZFC Regular Open Set","display":"df-zfc-regular-open-set — ZFC Regular Open Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-regular-open-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-regular-open-set","58-df-zfc-top4-regular-open-set","58-df-zfc-top7-regular-open-set"],"display":"df-zfc-regular-open-set — ZFC Regular Open Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-regular-open-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-regular-open-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-top4-regular-open-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-top7-regular-open-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-regular-open-set — ZFC Regular Open Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,X,\\tau\\in V\">\\(U,X,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\)</span> (topology predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularOpenSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RegularOpenSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop7RegularOpenSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularOpenSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RegularOpenSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop7RegularOpenSet}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}regular\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularOpenSet}_S(U,X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land U\\in\\tau\\\\\n&amp;\\land\nU=\n\\bigcup\\left\\{\nO\\in\\tau:\nO\\subseteq\nX\\setminus\\bigcup\\{W\\in\\tau:W\\cap U=\\varnothing\\}\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}regular\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularOpenSet}_S(U,X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land U\\in\\tau\\\\\n&amp;\\land\nU=\n\\bigcup\\left\\{\nO\\in\\tau:\nO\\subseteq\nX\\setminus\\bigcup\\{W\\in\\tau:W\\cap U=\\varnothing\\}\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}regular\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RegularOpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularOpenSet}_S(U,X,\\tau),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}regular\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RegularOpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularOpenSet}_S(U,X,\\tau),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}regular\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7RegularOpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularOpenSet}_S(U,X,\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}regular\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop7RegularOpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularOpenSet}_S(U,X,\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The topology axiom and carrier are explicit, and both aliases delegate to\nthe same core definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-top4-regular-open-set</code> and <code>58-df-zfc-top7-regular-open-set</code> are merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U,X,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularOpenSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RegularOpenSet}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcTop7RegularOpenSet}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}regular\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularOpenSet}_S(U,X,\\tau)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\n\\land U\\in\\tau\\\\\n&\\land\nU=\n\\bigcup\\left\\{\nO\\in\\tau:\nO\\subseteq\nX\\setminus\\bigcup\\{W\\in\\tau:W\\cap U=\\varnothing\\}\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top4\\text{-}regular\\text{-}open\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop4RegularOpenSet}_S(X,\\tau,U)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularOpenSet}_S(U,X,\\tau),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top7\\text{-}regular\\text{-}open\\te